  title: Diary Entry 1
  mission: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8a619ff05acad9d43a566640fcd02f31, type: 2}
  OnTranscriptClosed:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  leftTextBox: "I can\u2019t believe there are only two weeks left\u2026 Two weeks
    left and Luke still hasn\u2019t tried to talk to me again. Which, I know! Is
    technically my fault, because I\u2019m the one who told him we needed a break!
    But can you blame me? I mean, we used to make plans together. But over time,
    it\u2019s been less and less us reaching out to each other and more and more
    just me reaching out to him. \r\n\r\nUgh, was it a mistake? Taking a break? No.
    No, I needed a break. Trying to talk to him about it felt like an uphill battle.
    But I still want to talk to him. Hmm no, that\u2019s not right. I want him to
    talk to me. Reach out to me again. God, I still remember. Back in junior year,
    when he gave me those three little flowers he\u2019d picked and asked me out.
    And then we\u2019d make plans, and sometimes he\u2019d get me them again. Something
    like that would be nice. Just something to show me he still wants to spend time
    together."
  rightTextBox: '[ Temp Text, Flower sketch sprite will display here eventually]'
